<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that Parker-Hannifin Corp, Sparton Corp and Dole Food Co were unavailable for after hours trade for news.</p>
<p>The NYSE said that Corimon SACA was also unavailable for after hours trade.</p>
<p>After the market closed, Parker-Hannifin said that it expects earnings for its first quarter ended September 30 to be 10 to 15 percent below the previous first quarter.</p>
<p>Sparton said it sold its KPI unit and plans to exit the auto supply business.</p>
<p>Dole Food said it sees third quarter results in line with the lower end of analyst estimates.</p>
</text>
